  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>Hi &nbsp; all，</p><p>《林海雪踪》活动于1月5日0点-1月9日24点上线，现同步Day5数据情况：</p><p>具体数据如下：<br /><strong>1、活动目标完成情况：</strong></p><p>活动目标：活动钻石消耗达<span> 2462</span>万钻石<br />目标完成度：截止到目前，活动消耗达&nbsp; 万钻石，目标完成度为61%；</p><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup><col /><col /><col /><col /></colgroup><tbody><tr><td class=\"highlight-grey\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>活动名称</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" style=\"text-align: left;\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>活动消耗</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>活动目标</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>目标完成度</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">林海雪踪</td><td>24622195</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">40000000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">61%</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><strong>2、大盘数据情况：</strong></p><p>活动消耗占比大盘消耗的 14.14%，专属礼物消耗占比大盘礼物消耗的16.84%；</p><p>其中普通礼物消耗1581万钻，小映礼物消耗881万钻。</p><table><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><br /></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>主板消耗&nbsp;</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>礼物消耗</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>活动消耗</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>礼物消耗</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>&nbsp; 小映礼物消耗</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>活动占主板</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>礼物消耗占比</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><p><strong>20260105</strong></p></td><td><p>34265631</p></td><td><p>19958809</p></td><td>5818791</td><td>3710191</td><td>2108600</td><td>16.98%</td><td>18.59%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><p><strong>20260106</strong></p></td><td><p>38842881</p></td><td><p>19577485</p></td><td>6054547</td><td>4086347</td><td>1968200</td><td>15.59%</td><td>20.87%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><p><strong>20260107</strong></p></td><td><p>34649004</p></td><td><p>19498203</p></td><td>4139519</td><td>2363719</td><td>1775800</td><td>11.95%</td><td>12.12%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><p><strong>20260108</strong></p></td><td><p>32063385</p></td><td><p>16006465</p></td><td>3901521</td><td>2546921</td><td>1354600</td><td>12.17%</td><td>15.91%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><p><strong>20260109</strong></p></td><td><p>34254275</p></td><td><p>18571564</p></td><td>4707817</td><td>3103617</td><td>1604200</td><td>13.74%</td><td>16.71%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>合计</strong></td><td>174075176</td><td>93612526</td><td>24622195</td><td>15810795</td><td>8811400</td><td>14.14%</td><td>16.84%</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p>主播收礼：</p><p>全部礼物，派对和秀场主播的收礼占比为：64 : 35。</p><table><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>场景</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>20260105</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>20260106</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>20260107</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>20260108</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>20260109</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>总计</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>占比</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>派对</strong></td><td>10977000</td><td>12015891</td><td>7247628</td><td>6928407</td><td>9177957</td><td>46346883</td><td>64.48%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>秀场</strong></td><td>6007548</td><td>5814270</td><td>4663134</td><td>4759329</td><td>4289238</td><td>25533519</td><td>35.52%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>整体</strong></td><td>16984548</td><td>17830161</td><td>11910762</td><td>11687736</td><td>13467195</td><td>71880402</td><td><br /></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><strong>3、各层级主播收礼数据</strong></p><p>派对侧收礼的主播主要集中BN层级，秀场侧收礼的主播主要集中在B层级。</p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 29.6281%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 17.7214%;\" /><col style=\"width: 22.858%;\" /><col style=\"width: 18.2351%;\" /><col style=\"width: 22.6012%;\" /><col style=\"width: 18.4957%;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong title=\"\">主播61天动态层级</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong title=\"\">派对</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong title=\"\">占比</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong title=\"\">秀场</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong>占比</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>A</strong></td><td>1587106</td><td>3.31%</td><td>3128854</td><td>6.53%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>B</strong></td><td>8875382</td><td>18.52%</td><td>7575444</td><td>15.81%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>B-</strong></td><td>4532850</td><td>9.46%</td><td>1834742</td><td>3.83%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>C</strong></td><td>3528548</td><td>7.36%</td><td>1192132</td><td>2.49%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>D</strong></td><td>1183676</td><td>2.47%</td><td>274786</td><td>0.57%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>N</strong></td><td>5887808</td><td>12.29%</td><td>19624</td><td>0.04%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>S</strong></td><td>5302552</td><td>11.07%</td><td>2996764</td><td>6.25%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>总计</strong></td><td>30897922</td><td>64.48%</td><td>17022346</td><td>35.52%</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p><strong>4、各层级用户送礼数据</strong></p><p>派对侧送礼的用户主要集中BD层级，秀场侧送礼的用户主要集中在B层级。</p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 30.2358%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 24.1454%;\" /><col style=\"width: 21.9%;\" /><col style=\"width: 17.6207%;\" /><col style=\"width: 19.8862%;\" /><col style=\"width: 16.3621%;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong title=\"\">用户25日动态层级</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong title=\"\">派对</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong title=\"\">占比</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong title=\"\">秀场</strong></td><td class=\"highlight-grey\" data-highlight-colour=\"grey\"><strong title=\"\">占比</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>A</strong></td><td>827211</td><td>3.36%</td><td>814474</td><td>3.31%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>B</strong></td><td>6885961</td><td>27.97%</td><td>3639652</td><td>14.78%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>C</strong></td><td>2241227</td><td>9.10%</td><td>967800</td><td>3.93%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>D</strong></td><td>3515618</td><td>14.28%</td><td>1292551</td><td>5.25%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>E</strong></td><td>1477421</td><td>6.00%</td><td>579607</td><td>2.35%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>F</strong></td><td>280632</td><td>1.14%</td><td>96353</td><td>0.39%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>N</strong></td><td>324953</td><td>1.32%</td><td>115879</td><td>0.47%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>S</strong></td><td>254829</td><td>1.03%</td><td>1308027</td><td>5.31%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td><strong>总计</strong></td><td>15807852</td><td>64.20%</td><td>8814343</td><td>35.80%</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p><br /></p><p>以上，如有问题及时沟通～</p><p><br /></p>"